# ── Generated output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Printouts are regenerated on demand by `npm run print`; they are large,
# binary, and change whenever the renderer or a glyph does — exactly the sort
# of thing that makes a diff useless. Keep them out.
test/printout/out/

